// =============================================================================
// MapAble REPL → mapableau-new Prisma model additions
// =============================================================================
//
// These models must be appended to mapableau-new's prisma/schema.prisma and
// then a migration generated with:
//   pnpm prisma migrate dev --name "add-repl-port-models"
//
// Field extensions on the existing User model are noted separately below as
// they must be added to the existing model block, not as new models.
//
// =============================================================================

